<title>USA: United Airlines cargo revenue rises.</title>
<headline>United Airlines cargo revenue rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UAL Corp's United Airlines said its worldwide cargo division had a record $772.5 million in revenue in 1996, up 4.1 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>Cargo revenue ton miles rose 5.7 percent, with freight ton miles up 5.8 percent and mail ton miles up 5.2 percent, United said.</p>
<p>UAL shares were up 1/2 at 56-1/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
